EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hello!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Did you and {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
plan to be here at the same time?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}That's really very sweet of you!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Holita!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Qué coincidencia, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
también ha venido de visita.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Me encanta hacer de anfitriona,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}! Os voy a sacar unas
galletas de rechupete.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} merhaba!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sen ve {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} aynı anda
gelmeyi mi planladınız?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Çok tatlısınız gerçekten!
